  "notes": "Steps rewritten on day 4 to unblock Q26. jaeger-ui does not run a search from ?service= in the URL: the param is applied before the async services list resolves, so the Select stays empty and Find Traces stays disabled. The plan now drives the form: open the antd Select (data-testid=service), pick the option, wait for the submit button to enable, and click it. Both locators are identical at 061fa3db (2.19.0) and 05b8aedb (2.20.0), checked in SearchForm.tsx, so the steps cannot silently mean different things on the two sides of the pair. Predicates are the day-3 navigation-keyed pair, derived from the fix diff rather than the issue text: ClickToCopy.whenClicked gained e.preventDefault(), so on 2.20.0 the trace-ID click copies without navigating, while on 2.19.0 the native anchor default still fires and loses router state, taking the back arrow with it."
